        "description": "She is a childhood friend of [Hose](https://anilist.co/character/154565/Yasuo-Hazuki) and a second-year student at Karashobu High School. \n\nIn stark contrast to [Cherry](https://anilist.co/character/152054/Momo-Sakurabara), who is always by her side, she is a very quiet and mysterious girl. However, she seems to open up completely to Hose; her expression changes so drastically in those moments that she looks like a totally different person—girls really are a mystery, aren't they? \n\nHer nickname comes from combining the characters for \"moon\" (*tsuki*) and \"viewing\" (*mi*) from her real name.\n",
